<title>USA: Vinland Property Trust FY 96 FFO increases.</title>
<headline>Vinland Property Trust FY 96 FFO increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.63		    $0.02</p>
<p> Net			    853			 27</p>
<p> Revs			 9,500		    8,400</p>
<p>Funds from</p>
<p>    operations		949			828</p>
<p>Funds from operations</p>
<p>    per shr		  0.70		     0.59</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,354		    1,392</p>
